[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0592","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0592.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57254","title":"DENX Das U-Boot squashfs 文件系统符号链接大小计算整数溢出漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 引导加载程序中的 sqfs_inode_size 函数在处理 squashfs 文件系统时存在整数溢出漏洞，具体发生在符号链接大小计算过程中。攻击者通过物理方式访问目标设备并挂载特制的 squashfs 文件系统镜像，可触发该整数溢出，导致内存破坏，最终实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Das U-Boot 2025.01-rc1 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。由于需要物理访问且攻击复杂度较高，实际利用门槛较高，但仍对嵌入式设备和 IoT 系统构成严重安全威胁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57254"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09.523","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:27.810","remediation":"升级 Das U-Boot 至 2025.01-rc1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 sqfs_inode_size 中符号链接大小计算的整数溢出问题。Debian 11 用户可安装 DLA-4150 安全更新（apt update && apt upgrade u-boot）。如无法立即升级，避免在 U-Boot 中加载或挂载来源不可信的 squashfs 镜像文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/c8e929e5758999933f9e905049ef2bf3fe6b140d","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57254.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57254.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57254.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57254","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57254.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57254-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/moyamartin/meta-rpi-mmoya/blob/503560d3dcf3bf87d8e93ed59f202e9120db397b/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57254.patch","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57254.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57254-an-integer-overflow-in-sqfs-inode-s-1771411400000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-66gw-8528-j2rp/GHSA-66gw-8528-j2rp.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0592.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0563","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0563.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56171","title":"libxml2 libxml2 释放后使用漏洞","description":"libxml2 在 2.12.10 之前版本及 2.13.x 至 2.13.5 版本的 xmlschemas.c 中 xmlSchemaIDCFillNodeTables 和 xmlSchemaBubbleIDCNodeTables 函数存在释放后使用漏洞（CWE-416）。攻击者需构造恶意 XML 文档并针对特定身份约束的 XML Schema 进行验证，或使用恶意 XML Schema，即可触发释放后使用导致内存损坏。该漏洞影响广泛使用 libxml2 的 XML 处理应用，CVSS 7.8（HIGH），攻击向量为本地、攻击复杂度高、无需权限与用户交互，成功利用可导致高机密性和完整性影响。修复版本为 2.12.10 及 2.13.6 及以上版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56171"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T22:15:12.797","updated":"2026-06-17T08:11:46.753","remediation":"立即更新 libxml2 到稳定版本 2.12.10 或更高版本（或 2.13.6），禁用 DTD 验证或加载特信任 XML 文档功能，如果无法立即打补丁，可在应用层面使用安全的 XML 解析器或限制外部实体处理，在使用 libxml2 的应用程序中添加 XML 文档长度验证措施作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2/-/issues/828","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/10","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/11","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/12","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/13","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/4","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/5","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/8","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/9","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/02/msg00028.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250328-0010/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56171.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56171.json","https://github.com/hashicorp/consul-k8s/blob/66f49d366dff263db55a96b45130d334d46f2da4/.changelog/4570.txt","https://github.com/sparklemotion/nokogiri/blob/80a20e46d767990d84e28a2b8e5c536022e222d1/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-56171.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-56171","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56171.json","https://github.com/percona/percona-toolkit/blob/427b0d89dd2fe9c50278a2822af8cda5b01bea0e/docs/release_notes.rst","https://github.com/openshift/openshift-docs/blob/e9e1710ea99ad94cfc93205a40e9e2e099942d2c/modules/network-observability-operator-release-notes-1-8-1-cves.adoc","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/6ca8a69233790aa99633b6ad5606668ac000cf96/main/libxml2/APKBUILD"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0563.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0523","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0523.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45783","title":"GNU GRUB2 HFS+ 文件系统驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"GRUB2 的 HFS+ 文件系统驱动在处理挂载失败时未正确设置 ERRNO 值，导致引用计数（refcount）被重复递减两次，进而触发空指针访问。本地攻击者需具备高权限，通过挂载特制的恶意 HFS+ 文件系统即可触发此漏洞，造成系统崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 GRUB2 引导程序的各类 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 4.4，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.4,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45783"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T20:15:19.560","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41.793","remediation":"升级 GRUB2 至修复版本：Debian Bullseye 升级至 2.06-3~deb11u7，Bookworm 升级至 2.06-13+deb12u2，Trixie 升级至 2.12-9+deb13u2，Sid 升级至 2.14-3；RHEL/AlmaLinux 系列安装 ALAS2023-2025-937 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在 grub.cfg 中禁用 HFS+ 文件系统支持（不加载 hfsplus 模块）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:6990","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45783","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345863","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45783.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45783.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/b8117fffa9486975f050b7b07cfad353ee71453e/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45783","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45783.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45783.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45783.md","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-45783.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0523.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0521","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0521.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45781","title":"GNU GRUB2 UFS 文件系统堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GRUB2 的 UFS 文件系统解析器在处理符号链接名称时，未对输入的字符串长度进行有效性校验，导致堆内存越界写入漏洞。攻击者需要具备本地高权限，通过挂载特制的 UFS 文件系统触发该漏洞，可能破坏系统数据完整性并绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动保护机制。该漏洞影响所有使用 GRUB2 引导程序的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 6.7，危害等级中等。建议用户及时更新 GRUB2 至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45781"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T20:15:19.450","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41.560","remediation":"升级 GRUB2 至修复版本：Debian 用户升级至 2.06-3~deb11u7（bullseye）或 2.06-13+deb12u2（bookworm）；Ubuntu 用户安装对应安全更新；RHEL 用户安装 RHSA 更新。如无法立即升级，在 UEFI 安全启动环境中启用 Secure Boot 并确保 shim 已更新，限制本地攻击者加载恶意 grub 模块。补丁将 grub_ufs_lookup_symlink 中的 grub_strcpy 替换为 grub_strlcpy 以校验符号链接名长度，防止堆越界写入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:16154","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:6990","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45781","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345857","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45781.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45781.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/b14f5555ae5b53d86b7353a1ef112eb3496498f9/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45781","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45781.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45781.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45781.md","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-45781.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0521.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0516","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0516.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45776","title":"GNU GRUB2 .mo文件解析整数溢出堆越界读写漏洞","description":"Grub2 的 grub_mofile_open() 函数在处理语言 .mo 文件时，未对内部缓冲区大小计算过程中的整数溢出进行正确校验，导致缓冲区分配大小计算溢出，进而引发堆越界读写。本地攻击者需具备高权限，通过加载特制的 .mo 语言文件触发该漏洞，可造成敏感数据泄露或关键数据覆写，甚至绕过安全启动（Secure Boot）保护机制。该漏洞影响所有使用 Grub2 的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 6.7，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45776"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T20:15:19.313","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:40.930","remediation":"立即更新 grub2 至修复版本：RHEL 9 升级至 grub2-2.06-104.el9_6 及以上（RHSA-2025:6990），RHEL 10 升级至 grub2-2.12-15.el10_0 及以上（RHSA-2025:16154）。其他发行版请更新至 grub2 最新补丁版本。更新后执行 `grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/grub2/grub.cfg` 重新生成引导配置，并重新安装 grub 到引导扇区（`grub2-install`），同时重新注册 Secure Boot 密钥以确保安全启动保护生效。临时缓解措施：限制物理控制台访问权限，仅允许受信任管理员操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:16154","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:6990","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45776","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2339182","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45776.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45776.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/13599c523c76c621fa9bc4ca64223d269ca5155c/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45776","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45776.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45776.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45776.md","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-45776.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0516.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0515","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0515.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45775","title":"GNU GRUB2 extcmd 空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Grub2 引导加载程序中的 grub_extcmd_dispatcher() 函数在调用 grub_arg_list_alloc() 分配参数列表内存时，未对内存分配失败进行返回值检查。当内存分配失败时，空指针被传递给 parse_option() 函数进行处理，导致 Grub 崩溃或在罕见场景下破坏中断向量表（IVT）数据。该漏洞需要攻击者具有高权限且能够本地访问系统，攻击复杂度较高，影响使用 Grub2 的各类 Linux 发行版。攻击者可通过精心构造的引导配置触发内存分配失败，进而引发拒绝服务或潜在的数据损坏。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.2,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45775"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T20:15:19.177","updated":"2026-07-20T06:16:20.397","remediation":"立即将 GRUB2 升级至包含上游提交 05be856a8c3aae41f5df90cab7796ab7ee34b872 的版本（该提交在 grub-core/commands/extcmd.c 的 grub_extcmd_dispatcher 函数中增加了对 grub_arg_list_alloc 返回值的 NULL 检查）。各发行版用户请安装对应的安全更新：RHEL 用户安装 RHSA 安全公告对应更新，Ubuntu 用户等待 grub2-unsigned/grub2-signed 包更新至修复版本。如无法立即升级，可通过限制本地高权限用户对 GRUB 引导配置的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:6990","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45775","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2337481","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45775.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45775.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/d4334910758429a4752d1bf638835a207844ed7e/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45775","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45775.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45775.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45775.md","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-45775.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0515.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0514","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0514.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45774","title":"Grub2 JPEG解析器堆越界写入漏洞","description":"Grub2 的 JPEG 解析器在处理特制 JPEG 图片文件时存在堆越界写入漏洞。由于 JPEG 解析过程中对内部缓冲区边界检查不充分，攻击者可通过向系统加载特制的 JPEG 图片触发该漏洞，造成堆内存越界写入。成功利用此漏洞可能覆盖敏感数据，进而绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动保护机制。该漏洞需本地高权限访问，影响使用 Grub2 引导程序的各种 Linux 发行版。建议用户及时安装厂商提供的补丁更新。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45774"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T19:15:16.387","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:40.800","remediation":"将 grub2 升级至 2.12 以上版本。各发行版操作如下：RHEL 9 用户执行 `dnf update grub2` 升级至 grub2-1:2.06-104.el9_6 及以上版本（对应 RHSA-2025:6990）；Debian/Ubuntu 用户执行 `apt update && apt upgrade grub-pc` 获取包含上游补丁的更新包；其他发行版更新 grub2 至含 commit 2c34af90 的版本。更新后执行 `grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/grub2/grub.cfg`（UEFI 环境下为 `grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg`）重新生成引导配置，并重启系统使修复生效。如无法立即更新，可启用 Secure Boot 并配置 shim 签名验证作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:6990","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45774","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2337461","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-45774.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45774.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45774.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/d4334910758429a4752d1bf638835a207844ed7e/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45774","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45774.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c723932b6cef36d7df29b07fee2ccc4a2e5a8288/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45774.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45774.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-45774.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0514.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0544","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0544.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-50609","title":"Fluent Bit OpenTelemetry输入插件空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Fluent Bit 3.1.9 的 OpenTelemetry 输入插件存在空指针解引用漏洞。当该插件监听网络端口运行时，攻击者可向目标发送 Content-Length 为 0 的特制数据包，触发 process_payload_traces_proto_ng() 函数在处理过程中将 0 值传递给 cfl_sds_len 函数，该函数尝试对空指针进行类型转换导致程序崩溃。此漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，攻击者只需能够访问 OpenTelemetry 端点即可实施拒绝服务攻击，影响 Fluent Bit 3.1.9 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-50609"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T18:15:25.833","updated":"2026-06-17T08:04:47.890","remediation":"立即升级 Fluent Bit 至包含该修复的版本。官方已在 PR #9993 中修复此漏洞，修复合并于 2025-02-24，影响 master 及 v3.1/v3.2 分支。建议升级到 v3.1.10 以上、v3.2.x 最新版或 v4.2.5/v5.0.6 及以上版本（这些版本均包含该补丁）。如无法立即升级，可在 OpenTelemetry 输入插件前部署反向代理（如 Nginx），过滤掉 Content-Length 为 0 的请求，或在防火墙层面限制对 OpenTelemetry 端口的访问仅允许受信任来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fluentbit.io/announcements/","https://github.com/fluent/fluent-bit/releases","https://www.ebryx.com/blogs/exploring-cve-2024-50608-and-cve-2024-50609","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-50609.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50609.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/fluent-bit/CVE-2024-50609.patch","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2024/CVE-2024-50609.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50609.json","https://github.com/aws/aws-for-fluent-bit/blob/ce0e9647aeaec00260d1226d24cffcbb31e438e1/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-50609.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-x9j4-33qm-hgjp/GHSA-x9j4-33qm-hgjp.json","https://github.com/newrelic/docs-website/blob/be7242319b00b39f868f7d8e1ef18f20d335a1b2/src/i18n/content/kr/docs/release-notes/fluentbit-release-notes/fluentbit-25-02-27.mdx","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-50608.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0544.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0543","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0543.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-50608","title":"Fluent Bit Prometheus Remote Write输入插件空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Fluent Bit 3.1.9 版本的 Prometheus Remote Write 输入插件存在空指针解引用漏洞。当该插件运行并监听 IP 地址和端口时，攻击者可通过发送 Content-Length 为 0 的恶意数据包触发漏洞，导致服务器崩溃。漏洞根源在于 `process_payload_metrics_ng()` 函数处理 `Content-Length: 0` 时，将值 0 传递给 `cfl_sds_len` 函数，该函数试图对空指针进行类型转换引发空指针解引用。攻击者只需网络访问该端点即可发起远程拒绝服务攻击，无需身份认证。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-50608"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T18:15:25.667","updated":"2026-06-17T08:04:47.737","remediation":"升级 Fluent Bit 至 3.2.3 及以上版本（含 3.2.x 系列），或应用上游 PR #9993 的补丁（commit ed56831），在 prom_rw_prot.c 的 prom_rw_prot_handle_ng 函数中增加 Content-Length <= 0 和 body == NULL 的校验，返回 400 错误而非继续处理。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面限制 Prometheus Remote Write 输入插件的访问来源 IP，或在该插件前加反向代理对 Content-Length 为 0 的请求进行拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fluentbit.io/announcements/","https://github.com/fluent/fluent-bit/releases","https://www.ebryx.com/blogs/exploring-cve-2024-50608-and-cve-2024-50609","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-50608.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50608.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/fluent-bit/CVE-2024-50608.patch","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2024/CVE-2024-50608.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50608.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-50608.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-x9j4-33qm-hgjp/GHSA-x9j4-33qm-hgjp.json","https://github.com/newrelic/docs-website/blob/be7242319b00b39f868f7d8e1ef18f20d335a1b2/src/i18n/content/kr/docs/release-notes/fluentbit-release-notes/fluentbit-25-02-27.mdx","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-50609.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-50608.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0543.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2024/EXP-AVE-2024-0543.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0543.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0497","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0497.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-3220","title":"Python CPython mimetypes 模块不可信搜索路径漏洞","description":"CPython 标准库 mimetypes 模块在 Windows 平台上存在不安全的默认搜索路径缺陷。该模块将 Linux/macOS 上的默认 MIME 类型文件路径（如 /etc/mime.types）直接沿用至 Windows 系统，导致这些路径变为用户可写入位置（C:\\etc\\mime.types）。本地低权限攻击者可利用此缺陷创建恶意文件，在 Python 运行时启动时触发 MemoryError 导致拒绝服务，或使文件扩展名被错误解析为不正确的文件类型。该漏洞影响所有使用 CPython 的 Windows 系统，CVSS 评分 2.3，危害等级低。建议用户在 Windows 平台上调用 mimetypes.init([]) 传入空列表以规避默认路径。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-3220"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-14T17:15:15.567","updated":"2026-06-17T07:43:33.550","remediation":"升级至 Python 3.14.0 或更高版本，此版本已修复 mimetypes 模块在 Windows 上误用 Unix 默认路径的问题。如无法升级，可在 Windows 平台调用 mimetypes.init([]) 传入空列表以避免使用默认的已知文件位置列表作为临时缓解措施。此外建议删除 C:\\etc\\mime.types 等可能被利用的恶意文件并限制 C:\\etc 目录的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/CDXW34ND2LSAOYAR5N6UNONP4ZBX4D6R/","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/14/8","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250314-0001/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2024/3xxx/CVE-2024-3220.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-32206.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/acd6946b811240fd9eb8b4695a0847eda8db127d/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-3220","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-3220.json","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/f57e06c0c7b224221d0799ea8cea7dd8215a9a29/osv/python/CVE-2024-3220.json.sha512","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2024/CVE-2024-32205.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-3220.md","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/vt-feed/nasl/2025/python/gb_python_CVE-2024-3220_win.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-3220.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CVE-2024-3220-2025-04-05-2005","https://github.com/Lucky-lm/CVE-2024-32205"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0497.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0497.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0483","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0483.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12797","title":"OpenSSL RFC7250 原始公钥服务器认证绕过漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 的 RFC7250 原始公钥（RPK）认证实现存在安全缺陷，当 TLS 客户端启用 SSL_VERIFY_PEER 验证模式且服务器发送的 RPK 与预期公钥不匹配时，握手未按预期中止，导致客户端无法感知服务器身份验证失败。攻击者可在中间人位置利用此缺陷绕过认证，实施中间人攻击。该漏洞影响 OpenSSL 3.2 及以上版本（FIPS 模块不受影响），CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12797"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-11T16:15:38.827","updated":"2026-06-17T07:00:30.890","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSL 至 3.4.1（3.4 分支）、3.3.3（3.3 分支）或 3.2.4（3.2 分支）版本，其中包含针对 RPK 握手验证失败的修复。若无法立即升级，作为临时缓解措施，可禁用服务器端 Raw Public Key（RPK）功能（RPK 默认关闭，无需额外操作），或在客户端调用 SSL_get_verify_result() 手动检查验证结果。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/738d4f9fdeaad57660dcba50a619fafced3fd5e9","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/798779d43494549b611233f92652f0da5328fbe7","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/87ebd203feffcf92ad5889df92f90bb0ee10a699","https://openssl-library.org/news/secadv/20250211.txt","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/11/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/11/4","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250214-0001/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12797.md","https://github.com/fleetdm/fleet/blob/3bfec52fbacd342fd7cbae846c60f9e7a926fe84/security/vex/fleet/CVE-2024-12797.vex.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/fdc43b71a29cfc20dd1d437cc0240b9a31185623/doc/2025-02/CVE-2024-12797%20%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/blob/ba2f3b557a660cbe2a0fc0e99b1830cb930a090f/NEWS.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12797.json","https://github.com/saltstack/salt/blob/c8f7e9ab9b833333ac9d8d3d16e31878c58aab3e/doc/topics/releases/3006.10.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy/blob/e73c76d83b609cd5c387833e2467dbb52df06e46/docs/guide/configuration/reporting.md","https://github.com/google/boringssl/blob/bbae15127720290fb1216cf5a933a4bda6abf323/docs/advisories/2025-02-11.md","https://github.com/Azure/azure-cli/blob/6e3b4eab87bc1ec9e58d76361507e9e0be27dd4f/src/azure-cli-core/HISTORY.rst","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/cryptography/CVE-2024-12797.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0483.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0478","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0478.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12133","title":"GNU libtasn1 DER解码低效导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libtasn1 库在处理特定证书数据时存在解码效率低下的缺陷。当处理证书中大量元素时，libtasn1 的解析时间显著增加，导致系统响应缓慢甚至崩溃。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的证书文件触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响使用 libtasn1 库的各类应用和服务，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12133"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T16:15:37.260","updated":"2026-06-30T03:16:39.960","remediation":"将 libtasn1 升级至 4.20.0 或更高版本。Red Hat 发行版用户安装对应安全更新：RHEL 8 升级至 libtasn1-4.13-5.el8_10（RHSA-2025:4049），RHEL 9 升级至 libtasn1-4.16.0-9.el9（RHSA-2025:7077）。Debian/Ubuntu 用户通过包管理器更新至修复版本。无法立即升级时，在应用层限制证书中 Subject Alternative Name 和 Name Constraints 字段数量，或通过 cgroups 限制 libtasn1 进程的 CPU 使用率作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:17347","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:4049","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:7077","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8021","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8385","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:30849","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:30850"