472","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0472.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-11831","title":"npm serialize-javascript 跨站脚本(XSS)漏洞","description":"serialize-javascript npm 包存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，由于该模块未能正确过滤正则表达式等 JavaScript 对象类型输入，攻击者可向序列化数据中注入恶意代码，当浏览器反序列化时触发执行。该漏洞影响使用 serialize-javascript 处理用户数据的 Node.js Web 应用，可能导致敏感信息窃取或会话劫持。攻击者仅需诱导目标访问包含恶意序列化数据的页面即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2024-11831"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-10T16:15:37.080","updated":"2026-07-20T05:16:21.397","remediation":"将 npm 包 serialize-javascript 升级至 6.0.2 或更高版本（最新版 v7.0.7），修复提交为 f27d65d3。在 package.json 中将依赖版本锁定为 \"^6.0.2\" 后执行 npm install 更新。如无法立即升级，在反序列化用户可控数据前使用 DOMPurify 等库对输出进行转义过滤，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2025:0304","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:0381","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:10853","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1334","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:1468","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:21068","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:21203","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:3870","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:4511","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8059","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8078","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8233","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8479","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8512","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8544","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8551","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:9294","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1536","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2769","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:8568","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-11831","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2312579","https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/commit/f27d65d3de42affe2aac14607066c293891cec4e","https://github.com/yahoo/serialize-javascript/pull/173","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-11831.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2024/11xxx/CVE-2024-11831.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-11831.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-11831","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/serialize-javascript/CVE-2024-11831.yml","https://github.com/microsoft/garnet/blob/55c9884e431c0f6de62bf18cf919defd2de3cf95/website/package.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5462df1242ecdfa07cb8ddac80e6ca8fcb2b6836/2024/CVE-2024-11831.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-11831.json","https://github.com/mathworks/MATLAB-extension-for-vscode/blob/c7168a97a816202aa1606313f12e83daa7f2a910/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-11831"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0472.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0479","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0479.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12243","title":"GnuTLS libtasn1 DER解码远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"GnuTLS 依赖 libtasn1 处理 ASN.1 数据。由于 libtasn1 中 DER 解码算法存在复杂度缺陷，解析包含大量 subject alternative name 或 name constraint 字段的特制 X.509 证书时 CPU 消耗急剧上升。远程攻击者可发送恶意证书使 GnuTLS 服务 CPU 占用达 100%，导致响应缓慢或完全不可用，构成拒绝服务（DoS）风险。CVSS 3.1 评分 5.3，中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12243"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"2025-02-10","updated":"2026-06-17","remediation":"将 GnuTLS 升级至 3.8.8 或更高版本（3.8.0~3.8.7 均受影响，3.8.9 及以上不受影响）。RHEL 8 用户安装 RHSA-2025:4051 提供的 gnutls-3.6.16-8.el8_10.3 或更新版本；RHEL 9 用户安装 RHSA-2025:7076 提供的 gnutls-3.8.3-6.el9 或更新版本；RHEL 7 用户参考 RHSA-2025:17361。Debian 用户参考 DLA-4075-1。Siemens 设备用户关注 SSA-082556 和 SSA-202008。临时措施：在网络边界部署 TLS 拦截代理，限制单个证书中 SAN 及 name constraint 字段数量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:17361","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:4051","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:7076","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8020","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8385","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-12243","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2344615","https://gitlab.com/gnutls/gnutls/-/issues/1553","https://gitlab.com/gnutls/libtasn1/-/issues/52","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/02/msg00027.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250523-0002/","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-202008.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0479.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0591","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0591.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57075","title":"Eazy-Logger 原型污染拒绝服务漏洞","description":"eazy-logger v4.0.1 的 lib.Logger 函数存在原型污染漏洞，攻击者可通过向该函数传递特制的 payload 触发原型链污染，导致日志处理过程中出现未预期的行为，进而造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响使用 eazy-logger 组件的 Node.js 应用。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前已有公开 PoC 验证该漏洞的存在。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57075"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-05T22:15:31.803","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:17.013","remediation":"立即将 eazy-logger 升级至 v4.1.0 或以上版本（npm update eazy-logger），该版本已修复 lib.Logger 函数中的原型污染问题。如无法升级，可在调用 Logger 前对用户输入进行 JSON Schema 校验，过滤 __proto__、constructor 等危险键，或使用 Object.create(null) 创建无原型链的空对象作为日志配置参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","reference